# A WebAssembly registry that is not the vocabulary it publishes.
#
# Three defects, each one a real edit could introduce: a declared code with no row at all
# (UnsupportedBinaryVersion, 2002), a row whose name does not belong to its number, and a row dated
# from a revision the registry does not have. The rows it does carry are otherwise the real ones.
#
# registry-revision: 1
#
# code|name|pass|carrier|reason|reachability|case|since
2001|WrongMagic|decode|translation|MalformedEncoding|corpus|preamble-wrong-magic|1
2002|UnsupportedBinaryVersionExtended|decode|translation|UnknownFormatVersion|corpus|preamble-wrong-binary-version|1
2101|UnknownSectionId|decode|translation|InconsistentStructure|corpus|section-unknown-identifier|2
